<title>NETHERLANDS: P&amp;C OUT OF THE RED IN 1996/97.</title>
<headline>P&amp;C OUT OF THE RED IN 1996/97.</headline>
<dateline>AMSTERDAM 1997-04-29</dateline>
<text>
<p>Yr to Jan 31, 1997</p>
<p>(in millions of guilders unless otherwise stated)</p>
<p>    Net profit			     0.6  vs  15.5 loss</p>
<p>    Dividend (guilders)		nil    vs nil</p>
<p>    Turnover			     396    vs 412</p>
<p>    Cash-flow			     25.1  vs  12.4</p>
<p>NOTE - Clothing chain P&amp;C Groep NV said the turnover fall</p>
<p>reflected the sale of its unit Mac&amp;Maggie. Excluding that</p>
<p>effect, 1996/97 sales rose by seven percent.</p>
<p>P&amp;C previously said its reorganisation of recent years had</p>
<p>laid the foundation for a return to profitability.</p>
<p>-- Amsterdam newsroom +31 20 504 5000, Fax +31 20 504 5040</p>
